---
name: Mermaid-Diagram
description: Renders a Mermaid diagram. Stable types use a native fenced block; beta types (architecture-beta, kanban, xychart-beta, packet-beta, venn, ishikawa-beta) use a mermaid.ink image embed since Obsidian bundles an older renderer.
triggers:
  - "mermaid"
  - "diagram"
  - "chart"
---
{#
  Mermaid-Diagram.njk
  Variables:
    title     — diagram title (string)
    code      — Mermaid diagram source (string, required)
    beta      — set to "true" to force mermaid.ink embed (default: false)
    theme     — mermaid theme: default | dark | forest | neutral (default: default)
    caption   — optional caption
#}
{% set theme = theme | default("default") %}
{% set isBeta = beta | default("false") %}

{% if title %}
## {{ title }}
{% endif %}

{% if isBeta == "true" %}
{# --- mermaid.ink image embed (for beta types Obsidian can't render yet) --- #}
{% set payload = '{"code":' + (code | json) + ',"mermaid":{"theme":"' + theme + '"}}' %}
{% set encoded = payload | b64 %}

![{{ title | default("diagram") }}](https://mermaid.ink/svg/{{ encoded }}?bgColor=!white)

> [!note]- Source (mermaid.ink)
> ```mermaid
> {{ code }}
> ```
{% else %}
{# --- native fenced block (Obsidian renders these directly) --- #}
```mermaid
{{ code }}
```
{% endif %}

{% if caption %}
*{{ caption }}*
{% endif %}
